<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 88 0 R
/T (All collected inputs are analyzed by a Decision Engine that combines rule-based logic and machine learning techniques to classify viewing conditions as safe or unsafe and detect early signs of eye strain. Based on this analysis, the Adaptive Control Module dynamically adjusts screen brightness, font size, and line spacing through real-time frontend updates to optimize readability and comfort. The Output Module provides instant alerts, personalized recommendations, and reading performance analytics while continuously refining adjustments through AI-based learning. This architecture ensures a scalable, privacy-aware, and hardware-independent solution that transforms any standard device with a camera into an intelligent adaptive reading system.)
/E (All collected inputs are analyzed by a Decision Engine that combines rule-based logic and machine learning techniques to classify viewing conditions as safe or unsafe and detect early signs of eye strain. Based on this analysis, the Adaptive Control Module dynamically adjusts screen brightness, font size, and line spacing through real-time frontend updates to optimize readability and comfort. The Output Module provides instant alerts, personalized recommendations, and reading performance analytics while continuously refining adjustments through AI-based learning. This architecture ensures a scalable, privacy-aware, and hardware-independent solution that transforms any standard device with a camera into an intelligent adaptive reading system.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
